<title>USA: REMEC Inc 30-day post-merger results.</title>
<headline>REMEC Inc 30-day post-merger results.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN DIEGO, Oct. 28 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				REMEC Inc.</p>
<p>	   Condensed Consolidated Statement of Income</p>
<p>						  One month ended</p>
